gvM(){return"Yes, all shipments include real-time tracking. You can track your package using the tracking number provided at the time of shipment on our website or mobile app."},
gvC(){return"What areas do you serve?"},
gva(){return"Skypostal Logistics serves customers worldwide with a strong presence in North America, Europe, Asia, and Australia. Contact us for specific destination information."},
gvD(){return"What are your storage service options?"},
gvy(){return"We offer short-term and long-term storage solutions with temperature-controlled facilities, secure warehousing, and inventory management services tailored to your needs."},
gu8(){return"How do I schedule a shipment?"},
gvQ(){return"You can schedule a shipment through our website, mobile app, or by calling our customer service. We offer convenient pickup options or drop-off at our service centers."},
gty(){return"Do you provide logistics consulting for businesses?"},
gvN(){return"Yes, our team of logistics experts provides comprehensive consulting services to optimize your supply chain, reduce costs, and improve efficiency for businesses of all sizes."},
gvE(){return"What items are restricted from shipping?"},
gv6(){return"Restricted items include hazardous materials, illegal substances, perishable goods without proper packaging, and items prohibited by law. Please contact us for a complete list."},
